 usually > sometimes > never.\nThứ trong tuần luôn viết hoa: Monday, Sunday.","lessonId":"u5n1l2","lessonVersion":"v2.u5n1l2","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u5n1","order":32,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u5n1l2","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec1","signature":"ZznE7NJES2z9JruqE9FB0KFIn8MuAko2qEl4FTtDToUdeVtACGgLWxRxcSWhOUOvccSXUqzGyM7ne-PpP7NnCA","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["u5.vocab","u5.grammar","listening"],"title":"Mấy giờ rồi? · Bài 2","unitId":"u5"}